<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In On the Role of Temperature Samplingin Test-Time Scaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Extended Related Work</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
